        "text": "Reference class and base rate: for a monthly rounded participation-rate series, the best short-horizon reference class is recent same-series one-month changes in the same seasonally adjusted variant. The fetched 55+ path fell 0.2 percentage point from Feb to Jun but was unchanged at 37.1 in Apr, May, and Jun, so persistence at 37.1 is the base rate anchor."
